## ⛔ FINAL VERIFICATION (BLOCKING - DO NOT SKIP!)

**Before marking a UI task as complete, you MUST run these checks. Failure to do so = INCOMPLETE TASK!**

### 1. Verify Downloaded Libraries

```bash
# Check file sizes - if too small, download failed!
ls -la libs/

# Expected sizes:
# - tailwind.min.css: >10KB (if <5KB, build failed!)
# - alpine.min.js: >40KB (if <1KB, got redirect instead of JS!)
# - Any JS/CSS library: >1KB (if ~50 bytes, got error/redirect!)
```

**⚠️ Common download failures:**
- File contains "Redirecting to..." = Used `curl` without `-L`
- File is ~400 bytes = Got error page, not library
- Tailwind is <5KB = Wrong build command or v3/v4 mismatch

### 2. Take Screenshot with Playwright

```python
from playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright

with sync_playwright() as p:
    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True)
    context = browser.new_context(ignore_https_errors=True)
    page = context.new_page()

    # Collect console errors
    errors = []
    page.on("console", lambda msg: errors.append(msg.text) if msg.type == "error" else None)

    page.set_viewport_size({"width": 1920, "height": 1080})
    page.goto('https://127.0.0.1:5110/{PROJECT_FOLDER}/')
    page.wait_for_load_state("domcontentloaded")  # NOT networkidle — SSE/WebSocket pages never reach networkidle
    page.screenshot(path='/tmp/final_check.png', full_page=True)

    # MUST check for errors!
    if errors:
        print("❌ CONSOLE ERRORS FOUND:")
        for e in errors:
            print(f"  - {e}")
    else:
        print("✅ No console errors")

    browser.close()
```

### 3. Read and Verify Screenshot

Use `Screenshot` tool for visual verification — it captures, compresses, checks console errors, and works with all providers.

```python
# Quick verification with Screenshot tool
Screenshot(url="https://127.0.0.1:5110/{PROJECT_FOLDER}/page.php", reason="verify page layout")

# Check for:
# - [ ] Layout is correct (not broken)
# - [ ] Icons are visible and properly sized (not giant SVGs!)
# - [ ] Colors are applied (not all black/white)
# - [ ] Text is readable
# - [ ] No missing images (broken image icons)
```

### 4. Fix Any Issues Found

**DO NOT mark task complete if:**
- ❌ Console errors exist
- ❌ Layout is broken
- ❌ Icons are wrong size (giant SVGs = CSS not loaded!)
- ❌ Downloaded files are too small

**Common fixes:**
| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Giant SVGs | Rebuild Tailwind CSS properly |
| Console errors about missing files | Check file paths, re-download with `curl -L` |
| CSS not applied | Check `<link>` href path is correct |
| Alpine.js not working | Re-download with `curl -L -o` |

