## Tailwind CSS (MANDATORY - Copy from libs, NO npm build!)

**⚠️ IMPORTANT:** Copy pre-built Tailwind from `/opt/codehero/libs/`. NO npm, NO build needed!

```bash
# Create libs folder and copy Tailwind JS (RECOMMENDED - has ALL classes)
mkdir -p libs
cp /opt/codehero/libs/js/tailwind-v4-cdn.js libs/tailwind.js          # 398KB, ALL classes

# Also copy Alpine.js for interactivity
cp /opt/codehero/libs/js/alpine-3.min.js libs/alpine.min.js           # 46KB

# Copy FontAwesome for icons
cp /opt/codehero/libs/css/fontawesome.min.css libs/fontawesome.min.css
mkdir -p webfonts
cp /opt/codehero/libs/webfonts/* webfonts/

# Verify copies
ls -la libs/
```

**Include in PHP templates:**
```php
<head>
    <!-- Tailwind JS - has ALL classes, works immediately -->
    <script src="libs/tailwind.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="libs/fontawesome.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Your content with ANY Tailwind class -->
    <script src="libs/alpine.min.js" defer></script>
</body>
```

**WHY Tailwind JS instead of CSS?**
- JS version has **ALL** Tailwind classes (gradients, all colors, all variants)
- CSS version only has ~80% of common classes
- NO build step needed - just copy and use
- Works like CDN but completely LOCAL

### ⚠️ ALWAYS USE RELATIVE PATHS IN LINKS!

```php
<!-- ❌ WRONG - Will break on different IPs! -->
<a href="http://127.0.0.1/about.php">About</a>
<a href="http://localhost/admin/">Admin</a>

<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Always works! -->
<a href="about.php">About</a>
<a href="admin/index.php">Admin</a>
<a href="../index.php">Back to Home</a>
<link href="css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="js/app.js"></script>
```

**Download other libraries (ALWAYS use -L to follow redirects!):**
```bash
curl -L -o libs/alpine.min.js https://unpkg.com/alpinejs@3/dist/cdn.min.js
```

