## Visual Verification

Screenshots are cheap (~1K tokens each). **When in doubt, take a screenshot.**

```python
# Smart mode - auto-detects page height
Screenshot(url="https://127.0.0.1:9867/project/", capture_mode="smart", reason="verify page layout")

# For specific element
Screenshot(url="...", target_element="#contact-form", reason="verify form styling")
```

**Take screenshot after visual changes.** Skip only for config/backend-only changes.
